SUMMARY: Seniors Centre Open House
DESCRIPTION:The St. Lawrence Neighbourhood Association is hosting a drop-
 in and information sharing event in the "Seniors Resource Centre" at the 
 new Market North building at 92 Front St. E. Meet the SLNA Board of Direc
 tors and members of our Development Committee\, Heritage Committee and th
 e Waste Reduction Group. Learn what we've been doing lately on your behal
 f. Take a look at the new Seniors Centre space in this building\, and tel
 l us what programs and activities you would like to see happening there i
 n future.\n\nEveryone is welcome. Drop-in any time between 4:30 and 7:30 
 PM.\n\nSee you at the Market (North) on November 4th.
